7NA3MPEgQ7kNvwHs2wnr&_nc_oc=AdpW-DZdbNDhDI9c7gm2xkotY_EuQLTztVUvSobL--rIwoU8H0j8tqkFA1ObxTRxLGk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWcDH2uTg5IgiV_DAhVrkm5QdF4RhVTLEX2rKzXG1hdsw&oe=6B105F20"}, "display_name": "Close Encounters Demo", "keywords": ["UFO", "Paddle", "Ball", "Space"], "long_description": "VRelity Review: \"25 Best games in VR for Meta Quest 3 and Quest 2 that you have to play.\"\n\nUse your controller thumb sticks to deflect one or more balls to targets for collection.\n\nEach planet presents a challenging array of targets that must be collected to the waiting UFO above.\n\nPower-ups become available to assist in the collection process:\n- Extra Ball = Additional ball added to total balls available\n- Multi-Ball = Additional ball launched at location of power up\n- Power Ball = Blows through targets.  Lasts for 30 seconds.\n- Extra Time = Adds 60 to level timer\n\nBall speed increases and paddle size decreases as you progress through each challenge.\n\nTimed Demo Version: Play specific levels for about 60 seconds to get a feel for this game.\n", "short_description": "Lightning-fast reflexes are required to collect samples from each world and upload them to the hovering UFO.\n\nVRelity Review: \"25 Best games in VR for Meta Quest 3 and Quest 2 that you have to play.\"\n\nTimed Demo Version of \"Close Encounters\"."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.abbynormalproductions.net/privacy-policy-close-encounters", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.abbynormalproductions.net/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Abby Normal Productions, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.abbynormalproductions.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres":